<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff; padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#414141"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">6. Supporting Group Work</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

